R1027: Model 2B SHARC replay capture and R1026's data-memory cache model for MAME 0.289
(BSD-3-Clause files; this patch GPL-3.0-or-later as the project). Applied with patch -p1 on
top of mame_m2b_census.patch (sm2-builds/mame-m2b), built as that one is (SUBTARGET=m2lod).
Everything is env-gated; with nothing set MAME runs as before.
  R924_CAP=<dir>        <dir>/events.bin: the 2B board's copro traffic (model2.cpp's comment)
  M2B_TRACE=<n> [M2B_TRACE_FROM=<k>]  <dir>/strace.bin: <pc, state hash> for n words past k
                        that are not one-word waits (sharc.cpp's comment)
  M2B_CENSUS + M2B_XDM=<clk> M2B_DMC=<lines>:<words>[:2]  R1026's DM: block 1 below 8 K on
                        chip, the rest behind small caches, misses in totals.txt; paced, a
                        read miss charged M2B_XDM cycles
